            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/364d5b5145e29803539dd6f8b90d5bea.poster.avif?t=1769786947\" width=600 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/364d5b5145e29803539dd6f8b90d5bea.webm?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/364d5b5145e29803539dd6f8b90d5bea.mp4?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>System Shock é a recriação perfeita da obra-prima original de 1994. Combina a gloriosa jogabilidade com novos visuais HD, controlos atualizados, uma interface melhorada e novos sons e música: inclui ainda a voz original do ator de SHODAN, um dos vilões mais icónicos dos jogos. Testemunha o renascimento de um dos melhores e mais influentes jogos já criados.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/0760789597cf3fce8aa3896d9ef3361a.poster.avif?t=1769786947\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/0760789597cf3fce8aa3896d9ef3361a.webm?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/0760789597cf3fce8aa3896d9ef3361a.mp4?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ELA TEM CONSCIÊNCIA E OBSERVA-TE</h2><br><br>Eis SHODAN: a IA psicótica apoderou-se da Estação da Cidadela e transformou a tripulação num exército de ciborgues e mutantes. E agora planeia fazer o mesmo com a Terra. Enfrenta tudo e todos na tua jornada pelos confins desta estação infernal. Impede a SHODAN e evita a aniquilação da humanidade.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SÓ A SUA MORTE NOS SALVARÁ</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/d11ac169b25a00d80d4c098cd5926f53.poster.avif?t=1769786947\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/d11ac169b25a00d80d4c098cd5926f53.webm?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/d11ac169b25a00d80d4c098cd5926f53.mp4?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enfrenta as forças de uma IA vilã e enlouquecida<br></li><li>Melhora as tuas habilidades e adapta-te aos teus inimigos<br></li><li>Vive ao teu ritmo o desenrolar de uma narrativa não linear<br></li><li>Infiltra-te no ciberespaço, pirateia o sistema e abre rotas alternativas<br></li><li>As ilustrações inovadoras combinam o design retro futurístico com a tecnologia moderna</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/17f6b446cccbb59a81a79a67e32b91a8.poster.avif?t=1769786947\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/17f6b446cccbb59a81a79a67e32b91a8.webm?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/17f6b446cccbb59a81a79a67e32b91a8.mp4?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Imerge-te completamente: rasteja, trepa, salta e enfrenta tudo e todos na estação da cidadela com tiros e rixas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/6b048f17e1fb19eb750af63ac40ec6af.poster.avif?t=1769786947\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/6b048f17e1fb19eb750af63ac40ec6af.webm?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482400/extras/6b048f17e1fb19eb750af63ac40ec6af.mp4?t=1769786947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
